Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:10.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初中生田中爱之助自幼左眼几乎失明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:14.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在幼年时便失去了双亲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:17.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一直由哥哥梦人照顾抚养
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:25.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人得知爱之助有绘画天赋 便提议让他接受眼部手术 并由梦人捐献了自己的左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:30.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,后来梦人因意外身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助无法接受哥哥的死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:36.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,决心无论如何都要查明真相
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:39.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在接受左眼角膜移植后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.19,0:00:44.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每当受到撞击 爱之助眼前就会浮现出神秘画面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:49.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他开始怀疑 这些或许是哥哥曾经看过的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:52.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在保健老师狭山瞳的协助下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:55.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他终于一步步逼近真相
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抢劫银行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:05.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,乃至恐怖分子的病毒袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:09.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助终于发现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:13.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一切罪案的幕后黑手竟是自己的哥哥梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:15.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而梦人的真正目的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:20.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是从警方手中夺回存有犯罪计划的笔记本电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:24.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来哥哥还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:29.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并且是一个犯罪团伙的头目
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:32.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电脑虽然保住了 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.06,0:01:33.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:38.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我给你的那只左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:40.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥 住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:42.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我会继续做下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:46.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:51.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你想杀了我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:57.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算杀了你也可以……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:13.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:17.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,敬礼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:33.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第1集
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:51.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听到我声音的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:56.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们有家人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:03:00.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那种彼此互相关心的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:02.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真正的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:05.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算不生活在一起也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:10.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要心中把对方当作家人 那就是家人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,曾经连我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.93,0:03:17.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也有最亲近的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:21.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直以为 没有比我们更好的家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,然而我的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经不在我身边了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:33.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个把左眼给我的哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:34.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:05.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:19.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真抱歉 只能把你丢在雨里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:23.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是舞家里不准养狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们养不起你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:36.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它没有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以孤零零的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:40.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是孤零零的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:46.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你愿意跟我走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:51.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢大哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:57.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,舞的家就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有空要来找我玩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:41.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给你起个什么名字好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:52.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,叫凛吧 因为你威风凛凛的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:02.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经过去3个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:05.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那以后 这只眼睛什么画面也没看到过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算受到撞击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也再没有出现过神秘画面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:16.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会破坏你的计划 阻止你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有本事你就试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:21.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过到时候可别抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:24.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕哪天我不得不杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我确信哥哥一定在谋划着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定要阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:39.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕赌上性命 我也一定要阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:45.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凡有的 还要加给他 叫他有余
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:49.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凡没有的 连他所有的也要夺去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:58.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这本书里有时也能读出正确的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:05.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:10.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了执行计划
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:16.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经帮你安排进了福地警视手下的警局
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:22.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听说他是个低调沉稳的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.29,0:07:33.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经过去3个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:38.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,差不多该开始了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,黑晶晶——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:32.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,曾经是天才犯罪策划人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:36.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过那也仅仅是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在新王者出现之前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这台笔记本电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:56.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,属于据传在犯罪策划上超越了你的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我希望你能破解它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:05.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我们能获取里面隐藏的情报
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,郁美！郁美！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:39.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你 不要！！！郁美！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:35.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:43.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:45.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,翻译 - Annyti
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:46.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,校对 - SimusiK
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,英文字幕鸣谢 JUMP-in Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好 这里是保健室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:59.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您这个月的信用卡账单还没有还清
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:01.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会还的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:04.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在马上就去还！对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这可怎么办啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:19.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我分期付款买的东西 居然……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:23.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然还剩872,140日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:28.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是那双短靴真的太好看了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行 这不可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:38.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:42.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 全撕破了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:55.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了 要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:11:59.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,得赶快跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,时隔三个月 又看到画面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:09.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是否意味着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥又开始行动了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个画面到底代表什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:23.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我需要更多线索
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:27.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能再看到些什么就好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:33.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么也看不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:40.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天一定要揍爱之助一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:44.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要揍他 他就会看到画面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要看到画面 就能破案
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要破了案 警察就会感谢我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:53.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要警察感谢我们 就能拿到谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要拿到谢礼 我就能还清债务了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:13:02.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说 只要揍了爱之助 我就自由了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:07.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然我确实是个老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:09.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本来应该保护学生的老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:10.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是但是但是但是……！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:17.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我都要狠狠揍爱之助一拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:35.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:36.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.28,0:13:39.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么……？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:46.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上这样打个招呼 整个人不就精神一整天了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:14:01.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算老师打我 也是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:03.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前已经试过很多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:05.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是 可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,上次我们帮了警察
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:13.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是拿到了丰厚的谢礼呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:20.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不想再向那些害死你哥哥的家伙复仇了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你难道打算放弃吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以说……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:34.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们必须让你那只神奇的眼睛……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:39.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不可能随心所欲看到老师想看的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:50.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是我又看不到未来……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:53.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳老师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:59.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三个月前她帮过我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:04.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师并不知道哥哥的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,至今……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:11.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她还以为哥哥是被罪犯杀害的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:15.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方也是这么认为的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:19.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天讨论绑架案
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:27.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:31.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,趁母亲不注意时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:34.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人连同婴儿车一起绑架了一岁的平井郁美
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并驾驶一辆黑色面包车逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们未能拍清车牌号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:41.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以目前还无法确定犯人的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:44.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在孩子被扣为人质
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:45.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人索要赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,赎金金额为100万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:49.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人已经发来了指示
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:54.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“交给在大地上奔走 守卫地狱之门者”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:56.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这段是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:59.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者父亲按照指示行动的监控录像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,按照犯人的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:08.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他把100万日元放进狗的背包里 然后放走了狗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:12.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,带着赎金的狗在新中川附近出现过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但目前还不清楚它的确切位置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个计划真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:19.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,讨论犯人的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:25.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前警方正在追踪那只黑狗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以期掌握线索 查明犯人的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:42.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,背着背包的狗……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:49.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小女孩小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想不通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:59.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,线索太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:28.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:40.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:45.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得应该通知你一声
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:47.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经启动了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:55.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我的天才犯罪计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:17:59.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:06.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会阻止你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:08.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会阻止你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:18.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,挺自信的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你知道些什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:24.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,算了 无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你就好好努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:42.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在担心弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不要我杀了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:52.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:55.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:07.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:48.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 突然打扰……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:54.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您不用害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是住在附近的如月中学三年级学生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我叫田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:04.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最近您身边有发生什么奇怪的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.47,0:20:08.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,或者是小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:11.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有 我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:13.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:15.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别靠近小舞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:20.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你要是敢对她做什么 我就报警
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:17.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:20.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！你听说了吗？有婴儿被绑架了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:24.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就在这附近 好吓人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:26.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:32.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:35.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人也太残忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:39.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不去找有十亿日元的人要十亿日元
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:44.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明知受害人家里连维持生计都很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:47.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,却还要折磨人家 榨取那点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太残酷了……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:51.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么能做出这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:59.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我的天才犯罪计划……已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:01.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:04.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也听说那件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:06.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不是跟你说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:10.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别穿成这样出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:14.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,竟然派了只小狗去拿赎金？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:15.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.81,0:22:19.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 关于那封信……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:23.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“交给在大地上行走 守护地狱之门者 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:26.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可怜的小狗怎么就成守护地狱之门了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:29.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就像地狱三头犬那样吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:32.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我先走啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不用去上学吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:44.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:51.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:54.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,100万日元的赎金……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:58.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,人质被释放了……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.99,0:23:03.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥不可能只是为了区区100万日元做这种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:06.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那又是为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:09.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,完全想不通他的真正目的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:22.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那篇报道里提到的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:26.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,应该就是它吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:29.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那鸽子又是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:33.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:37.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,光凭这些根本弄不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:40.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了 左眼 再显现一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.30,0:23:44.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再给我一点线索！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:23:59.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:02.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.79,0:24:03.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.93,0:24:05.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有点贫血
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.73,0:24:19.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好像是田中爱之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.97,0:24:25.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三班的海藤正树
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.48,0:24:26.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我身体不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.69,0:24:30.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,经常请假 所以你可能不认得我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.74,0:24:36.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的便当呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.59,0:24:39.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没有买便当的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:41.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我家特别穷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.25,0:24:46.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 我不小心说太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.66,0:24:50.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有 我只是在想
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.19,0:24:52.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“换作是我 肯定没办法这么坦然地说出来 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.06,0:24:57.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实我家也差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.78,0:25:01.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,重要的是活得堂堂正正
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.42,0:25:03.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,贫穷并不是什么耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:08.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是我妈妈常说的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.23,0:25:10.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很像电视剧里的台词
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.68,0:25:15.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你妈妈真坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:17.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她是上门护理员
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.87,0:25:21.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以平时非常忙……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.32,0:25:24.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不是我身体太弱……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.52,0:25:27.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本来也能帮帮她的……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.67,0:25:40.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:43.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.33,0:25:55.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 是白鸽 平时可不多见呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.03,0:26:02.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来了……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:06.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.07,0:26:07.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了？开始了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.99,0:26:10.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是那个画面吗 爱之助？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.34,0:26:13.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你刚才一直都在跟踪我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.56,0:26:15.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么能凭空污蔑人呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.95,0:26:17.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.27,0:26:19.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能麻烦你转过去一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.00,0:26:20.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.23,0:26:22.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,千万别回头看哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.00,0:26:23.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好的……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:24.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:26.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请使出全力打我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:28.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.35,0:26:48.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“诱拐仍在继续”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.54,0:26:50.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“M将死”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.07,0:27:52.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:56.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的女儿在我手里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.11,0:28:00.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.07,0:28:02.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你刚才说了“绑架”？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.60,0:28:03.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.81,0:28:07.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说奖金能拿到大概十亿日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:12.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经看到成堆的钻石 钞票和黄金了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:14.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架和小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.69,0:28:18.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:21.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:22.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.05,0:28:25.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那些鸽子就是下一起绑架案的线索！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.52,0:28:27.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,手机借我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.71,0:28:29.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿去！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.37,0:28:38.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请帮我转接大市刑警
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.97,0:28:40.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.18,0:28:41.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他不在？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就转给加藤刑警
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.36,0:28:45.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:49.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开完会就外出了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.08,0:28:55.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有非常重要的线索……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.45,0:28:58.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然挂断了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.69,0:29:00.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.36,0:29:01.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉！下次再聊！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.75,0:29:06.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！我有加藤刑警的手机号！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.98,0:29:45.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？我是佐野……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.98,0:29:47.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.17,0:29:51.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有 我没报警
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.91,0:29:54.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问小舞她没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.28,0:29:57.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,准备好400万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.27,0:30:00.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,400万日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.32,0:30:02.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没有那么多钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.31,0:30:05.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.92,0:30:07.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.68,0:30:15.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是她真的凑齐了400万日元……该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.63,0:30:16.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凑不齐的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.35,0:30:21.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个母亲的能力也就那种程度
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.60,0:30:28.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算凑齐了 结果也不会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.80,0:30:32.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.71,0:30:36.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但那就没有美感了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.69,0:30:40.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,美感吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:48.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那当然 犯罪最重要的就是美感
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:30:56.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.39,0:30:59.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生的电话打不通
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:02.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起事件的详情呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.29,0:31:06.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还不能完全确定是否与第一起绑架案有关
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:09.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,两起案件非常相似
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:11.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 什么？
- 只是推测
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.82,0:31:14.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 讲详情！
- 是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.45,0:31:20.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者是佐野舞 小学二年级 8岁 住在篠出町
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.15,0:31:22.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人索要400万日元的赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:23.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人的交易条件呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.07,0:31:27.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之后犯人没再打电话 但发来了这条信息
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.56,0:31:35.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“交给衔着橄榄枝振翅之物”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.85,0:31:42.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“橄榄枝”？“翅膀”？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.98,0:31:46.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你究竟看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.99,0:31:49.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前不是已经发生过一起绑架案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:52.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那次是用狗取走赎金的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.31,0:31:58.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架案还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.72,0:32:00.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:06.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说 这次的受害者是……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.34,0:32:15.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.07,0:32:26.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您……我保证一定会还的……能借我一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.53,0:32:29.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 按照规定我们不能借
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.98,0:32:34.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是小舞有生命危险啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.16,0:32:36.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 但规定就是规定
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.05,0:32:38.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请您冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.25,0:32:43.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,佐野女士 有您的快递
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.49,0:32:47.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请开一下门
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.90,0:32:56.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是快递员
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.88,0:32:58.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 有您的快递 
- 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.73,0:33:00.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请在这里签字
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.69,0:33:05.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.78,0:33:11.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请慢慢把箱子放下 一定要轻拿轻放
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.83,0:33:27.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来不是炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.10,0:33:35.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:38.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.21,0:33:44.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“将赎金放入筒中后放飞”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.69,0:33:49.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然和福地警视说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.71,0:33:52.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.70,0:34:06.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一定要赶上啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.28,0:34:11.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.14,0:34:14.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已就位
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.69,0:34:16.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.84,0:34:20.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放飞鸽子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.39,0:34:34.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子正朝东南方向飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.62,0:34:39.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,全员注意 绝不能跟丢！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.45,0:34:45.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们正在追踪鸽子 它们正朝东南方向的中川下游飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:51.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算利用天空运送赎金 鸽子迟早也得落下来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.35,0:34:53.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,继续追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.90,0:34:59.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它们改变了方向 现在正朝西南方向飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.07,0:35:03.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不能放过这么精于算计的犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.11,0:35:29.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子正以70公里的时速向三浦半岛叶山町方向西南飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.47,0:35:32.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从B点转移到F点
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.09,0:36:00.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.05,0:36:02.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:04.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 别在工作时间给我打电话 
- 是鸽子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.78,0:36:08.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 什么？
- 它是下一起绑架案的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.51,0:36:10.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.98,0:36:16.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起绑架案的信息是严格保密的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.87,0:36:19.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,告诉我 快告诉我！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.40,0:36:20.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.91,0:36:24.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 你打电话就是为了这个？
- 对 我想告诉您关于鸽子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.74,0:36:27.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你看到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.98,0:36:29.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.69,0:36:31.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是感觉到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.67,0:36:38.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 3个月前你不是有过某种神奇的能力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.40,0:36:46.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是因为失去哥哥的打击 觉醒了这种能力？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:53.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道被绑架的是佐野舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.34,0:36:58.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？
- 你认识她？篠出町的佐野舞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.58,0:37:01.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶 我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:07.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在那边！鸽子！鸽子！在那边 那边！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.87,0:37:09.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是加藤
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.47,0:37:13.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子位置在东南方向100米处
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.40,0:37:24.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它们减速了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.54,0:37:47.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,头儿 这里出现了一大群鸽子！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.45,0:37:49.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知道该盯哪一只了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.88,0:37:53.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,赎金……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:18.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,运送赎金的鸽子……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.75,0:38:20.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,晚上本来就是不飞的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.62,0:38:26.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.99,0:38:28.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.96,0:38:35.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是YY金融的谷田部 早上给您打过电话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.65,0:38:40.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您这个月的贷款还没还呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.22,0:38:44.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.41,0:38:46.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是您家吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.40,0:38:48.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳女士
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.68,0:38:53.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一不小心走过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:54.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.85,0:38:58.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这全是胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.39,0:39:01.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在跟踪我！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.97,0:39:05.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为我太漂亮了……很吓人对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.34,0:39:07.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说 狭山老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.21,0:39:15.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,劝您最好别进我的黑名单
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.88,0:39:19.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:21.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 我们去学校吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.99,0:39:22.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.75,0:39:25.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去那边再计划 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.25,0:39:27.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.37,0:39:36.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.61,0:39:41.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.55,0:39:50.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,钱没给够啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.98,0:39:56.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你不够努力吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.07,0:40:03.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看穷人拼命凑钱的样子 还真是有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.29,0:40:08.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经很努力去凑钱了……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.29,0:40:11.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不想听借口
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:15.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那小舞呢……小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.79,0:40:19.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.57,0:40:23.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？求求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.43,0:40:26.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:31.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.08,0:40:35.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.22,0:40:38.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.35,0:40:57.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.91,0:41:14.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.34,0:41:16.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人来电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.34,0:41:18.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还是不知道小舞被关在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.50,0:41:20.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.53,0:41:27.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.50,0:41:30.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.10,0:41:32.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.94,0:41:53.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来应该想到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.01,0:41:57.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼看到的小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:02.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有那起绑架案……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.88,0:42:08.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是我能把这两幅画面联系起来 早就明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.21,0:42:12.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.78,0:42:15.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了 左眼 让我看到吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.85,0:42:19.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手 爱之助！快停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.31,0:42:27.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是哥哥能看到这一切……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.35,0:42:29.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到他犯下的罪行……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.83,0:42:35.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他怎么能……对那个小女孩……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.62,0:42:39.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.23,0:42:44.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥一定是被威胁了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.10,0:42:50.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以才帮了罪犯 最后还被害死了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.46,0:42:58.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别把哥哥想得那么坏
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.40,0:43:04.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信他当时一定很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.16,0:43:10.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以 爱之助 别那样说他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.10,0:43:19.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他可是你唯一的家人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.84,0:43:25.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢您 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.53,0:43:36.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不用谢……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.83,0:43:41.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.59,0:43:46.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们一起把那伙强盗抓住！好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.61,0:43:52.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.16,0:44:01.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实我哥哥还活着 现在正在策划新的犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.10,0:44:14.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥总会出现在有警察的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.12,0:44:20.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是敢碍事……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.23,0:44:27.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有比杀掉他更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.58,0:44:45.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,天才犯罪计划已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.81,0:44:49.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第一起案子索要了100万日元赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.51,0:44:52.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是用狗来运送的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.49,0:44:56.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起案子绑架了小舞
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.24,0:44:58.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人索要了400万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.79,0:45:02.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并且用鸽子取走了赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.24,0:45:06.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又借口金额不足 他们……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.84,0:45:10.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.31,0:45:14.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到现在还没把小舞放回来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.34,0:45:31.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 凛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.58,0:45:33.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,吓到你了 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.95,0:46:12.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看你们脸上的表情 是被耍得团团转呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.21,0:46:15.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,笔记本电脑破解了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.40,0:46:17.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.22,0:46:20.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里的防御系统相当坚固
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.84,0:46:25.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且解读密码的思路也很关键
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.73,0:46:31.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人是在故意拖延时间
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.16,0:46:38.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他喜欢故弄玄虚 绝不会走寻常路
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.31,0:46:39.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说……？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.86,0:46:41.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.73,0:46:46.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他觉得无聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.94,0:46:51.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道他现在在策划什么 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.55,0:46:57.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要有选择 他一定会选风险最高的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.75,0:47:03.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,更有趣 更耗时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.09,0:47:06.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且更残忍的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.14,0:47:31.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,救命……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.58,0:48:19.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.77,0:48:29.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.74,0:48:34.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你吗？之前来过的就是你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.98,0:48:38.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就是犯人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.90,0:48:41.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是不是你？！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.37,0:48:42.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.91,0:48:46.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你把小舞还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.02,0:48:51.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请把小舞还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.97,0:48:57.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把小舞还给我……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.20,0:49:01.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你了……求求你……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.68,0:49:05.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的 他是来帮我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.94,0:49:08.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人可能在监视 先进屋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.25,0:49:11.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你也进来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.26,0:49:15.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.58,0:49:19.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？
- 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.77,0:49:24.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 我是佐野
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.72,0:49:30.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经把你女儿放了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:37.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 既然你没能凑齐赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.26,0:49:42.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就不会告诉你她在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.15,0:49:47.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凭她自己是逃不出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.04,0:49:52.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不抓紧时间 她可是会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:56.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你 把她还……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.67,0:50:03.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们还剩2个小时 祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.05,0:50:12.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等一下！求求你等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:16.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吧 再给你一个提示
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.99,0:50:25.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前用的是狗和鸽子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.29,0:50:32.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次是另一种动物
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.14,0:50:46.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.19,0:50:53.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才明明有那么多的 都去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.24,0:50:58.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.73,0:51:00.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你又能看到什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.73,0:51:02.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得看看这次用的是什么动物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.82,0:51:05.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 怎么又是动物？
- 别管了！快揍我一拳
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.44,0:51:06.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:26.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.05,0:51:28.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到了吗？看到什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.43,0:51:41.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸭子？牛？马？蜥蜴？河马？长颈鹿？犀牛？猴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.98,0:51:44.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,自己出不来？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.70,0:51:46.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2小时后会死？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.08,0:51:55.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是被注射了毒药？缺氧？还是被活埋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:58.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次到底是什么动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.62,0:52:04.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 能让我看一下后座吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.98,0:52:13.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在找乐子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.39,0:52:16.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,觉得无聊？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.06,0:52:19.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喜欢冒险？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.18,0:52:22.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,提示是动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.27,0:52:24.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,豹子？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.35,0:52:25.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猪？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.46,0:52:26.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,山羊？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.65,0:52:27.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,隼？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.34,0:52:30.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猛犸象？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.30,0:52:32.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猎豹？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.22,0:52:37.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不对 猎豹说过了 
两个角的？㺢㹢狓！是㺢㹢狓吗？！㺢㹢狓？！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.17,0:52:39.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.74,0:52:41.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.80,0:52:45.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.38,0:52:49.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.67,0:52:50.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.52,0:52:52.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.99,0:53:07.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 我是加藤
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.28,0:53:09.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 加藤先生 我知道了！
- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.53,0:53:12.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请相信我的直觉 赶快过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.54,0:53:18.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.00,0:53:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.90,0:53:27.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.48,0:53:32.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,搜查全员请注意 去排查海边所有带有海狮标志的仓库！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.90,0:53:34.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.01,0:53:37.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者就在其中一个带有海狮标志的仓库里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.34,0:53:40.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请一定要救救她！拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.79,0:53:52.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海狮标志的公司？那一带少说有一百家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.65,0:53:56.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有没有别的线索能缩小地址？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.56,0:54:03.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 光顾着拼图都给忘了……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.98,0:54:06.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个风车到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.76,0:54:09.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是风力发电厂？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.37,0:54:15.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发电厂附近的仓库……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.26,0:54:18.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.95,0:54:32.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请出示您的驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.34,0:54:42.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.29,0:54:47.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这附近有仓库吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.15,0:54:52.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发电厂旁边好像就有一家
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.98,0:54:56.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,感谢您的配合
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.17,0:56:02.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在带有海狮标志的仓库里找到佐野舞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.70,0:56:08.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她没事吧？小舞没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:28.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出来了！小舞看起来没事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.73,0:56:31.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们马上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.04,0:56:34.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.48,0:56:49.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞 你怎么样？小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.45,0:56:54.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞 小舞 坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.51,0:56:56.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.33,0:56:57.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.95,0:57:02.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.20,0:57:04.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.34,0:57:08.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狗狗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.37,0:57:12.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在家里呢 它很好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.59,0:57:17.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 我给它起名叫凛 
- 太好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.37,0:57:21.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能请您先出来一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.67,0:57:23.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.87,0:57:25.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.52,0:57:28.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.42,0:57:31.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.51,0:57:33.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.06,0:57:36.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.48,0:57:50.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,佐野舞已经恢复意识了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.01,0:58:07.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.23,0:58:11.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经没事了 你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.20,0:58:17.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了……多亏了你的线索 附近的警官才能找到她
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.06,0:58:33.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么……不……难道说？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.12,0:58:47.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是青坂署的向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.98,0:58:57.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.67,0:58:59.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.34,0:59:02.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,佐野女士想向大家道谢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.01,0:59:04.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.51,0:59:16.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的天才计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.98,0:59:22.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打电话给福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.87,0:59:26.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,告诉他黑晶晶已经成功破解了防御
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.31,0:59:42.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.98,0:59:45.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.81,0:59:47.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.60,0:59:49.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.87,0:59:52.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 我也高兴！
- 我也太开心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.31,0:59:57.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,立了这么大功 会有谢礼的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.59,0:59:59.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.95,1:00:04.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然如此 绝对少不了谢礼！不知道会有多少呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.73,1:00:07.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.23,1:00:10.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤刑警
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.84,1:00:15.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.26,1:00:19.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么哥哥会……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.73,1:00:30.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真正的较量现在才要开始呢 弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.54,1:00:32.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.41,1:00:47.18,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.40,1:00:53.77,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.86,1:01:01.76,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.86,1:01:09.69,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.79,1:01:16.49,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.74,1:01:23.02,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.31,1:01:30.48,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.64,1:01:37.35,SongTop,,0,0,0,,坚信这份心意终能传达 直到实现
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.47,1:01:45.46,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 我们一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.67,1:01:51.73,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
